== Part C: Median

The median is the middle value when the scores are arranged in order. When there is an even number of values, the median is the average of the two middle values.

+ Which two scores are the middle scores of the ordered list? #line(length: 40%)

+ Find the median. #line(length: 40%)

== Part D: Mode and Range

The mode is the value that appears most often. The range is the difference between the highest and lowest values.

